---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CV"
  description="Curriculum vitae for Diogo Nunes — downloadable as a PDF."
>
  <h1>Curriculum Vitae</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    A downloadable PDF version is available below. This page is the online form.
  </p>

  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>
    Backend engineer focused on Java and Spring Boot, with hands-on experience
    deploying and operating services on self-hosted infrastructure. Comfortable
    across the whole stack: API design, containerization, CI/CD, networking, and
    documentation.
  </p>

  <h2>Experience</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="meta">Current</div>
    <h3>Personal Portfolio Platform</h3>
    <p>
      Designed, built, and operated this platform end to end: Astro frontend,
      Spring Boot API, Traefik, GitHub Actions, and a self-hosted Proxmox host.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="meta">Past</div>
    <h3>Backend Engineering</h3>
    <p>
      Java and Spring Boot services, containerized and shipped through CI/CD
      pipelines.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Java, Spring Boot, TypeScript</li>
    <li>Docker, Linux, networking, Traefik</li>
    <li>GitHub Actions, CI/CD, self-hosting</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Download</h2>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="/cv.pdf">Download CV (PDF)</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
